        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Cache, Oklahoma\n- People: Quanah Parker\n- Organizations: Quahadi Comanche, Comanche people\n- Places/Properties: Star House\n- Events/Topics: Indian Wars, transition to reservation life\n\nFacts:\n- Quanah Parker was born in about 1845 or 1852 and died on February 23, 1911.\n- Quanah Parker was a Comanche war leader of the Quahadi, or Antelope, band of the Comanche people.\n- Quanah Parker was the major leader of the Quahadi Comanche during the Indian Wars and the transition to reservation life.\n- Star House was the home of Quanah Parker.\n- Cache, Oklahoma, is the location of Star House.",
